<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Siwe-Palar-Khuppak</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">r. c. 1778 BCE</span> · <a href="/centuries/18th-century-bce">18th century BCE</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Siwe-Palar-Khuppak was a ruler of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/elam">Elam</a> around 1778 BCE during the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sukkalmah-period">Sukkalmah period</a>. He was a powerful figure in Mesopotamian politics at the time of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hammurabi">Hammurabi</a>. Accounts of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/elamite-confederation">Elamite Confederation</a> mention his military activity, as Elam intervened in Mesopotamian affairs.</p></div>
